sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as foreground UI
  participant R as Runtime Task
  participant I1 as sync iterator
  participant I2 as async continuation
  UI->>R: register foreground task
  loop each message
    UI->>I1: next()
    UI->>R: race backgroundSignal
  end
  R-->>UI: background signal
  UI->>I1: return() / cleanup finally
  UI->>I2: runAgent(isAsync, same task controller)
  I2->>R: progress then terminal
